  (at 100 100)
  (version 20221018)
  (generator pcb_antenna_designer)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Inverted-F antenna from Silicon Labs AN1088 (EM250/EM260 reference designs), dimensions from its Figure 2.1 and stackup from Figure 2.2: 4 layers, ground on layers 2 and 4 stitched with vias, no ground under the antenna, a 50 ohm (14 mil) microstrip feed. On the 62 mil (1.6 mm) boards Silicon Labs needed a series inductor of 1.8 to 2.0 nH to match it. The note does not give the ground plane size (it depends on the board): 30 x 40 mm here. Parameter values in mm (the note uses inches). Tuned in a commercial EM tool for 2.44 GHz without the 1.8-2.0 nH series inductor: the arm lowered to H = 5.831 mm and lengthened to L = 20.477 mm (AN1088: H 8.306, L 19.863). Accurate run: S11 -21.1 dB at 2.44 GHz (Z 50 - j9 ohm), -10 dB band 2.295-2.67 GHz, total efficiency 92 %, realized gain 2.5 dBi.")
  (tags "antenna IFA MIFA RF")
  (attr smd)
